issue: 220
title: a guarded skip respelled from trial's `unittest.SkipTest` to unittest's `SkipTest` is the skip the test had
origin: issue #220, found by the round's sweep: scrapy bb15c93a2bbd. Trial's SkipTest is unittest's class, so the respelling adds no skip. v0.6.0 passes this with zero findings; reading only unittest's spelling would have blocked it as a new skip
